# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 3: Graph 3-coloring (Max-3-Cut) {#example-3-graph-3-coloring-max-3-cut}"
msgstr "Contoh 3: Pewarnaan graf 3 (Max-3-Cut) {#example-3-graph-3-coloring-max-3-cut}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Max-$k$-Cut problem partitions the vertices of a graph into $k$ groups to maximize the number of edges whose endpoints belong to different groups. For $k = 3$ this is equivalent to finding a 3-coloring that maximizes cross-color edges.\n"
msgstr "Masalah Max-$k$-Cut mempartisikan bucu graf kepada $k$ kumpulan untuk memaksimumkan bilangan tepi yang titik akhirnya tergolong dalam kumpulan yang berbeza. Untuk $k = 3$ ini setara dengan mencari pewarnaan-3 yang memaksimumkan tepi silang warna.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formally, assign each node $i \\in V$ to one of $k$ groups with binary variables $x_{i,c}$ for color $c \\in \\{1, \\ldots, k\\}$. The one-hot constraint $\\sum_c x_{i,c} = 1$ for each node enforces a unique assignment. The objective maximizes cross-group edges:\n"
msgstr "Secara formal, tetapkan setiap nod $i \\in V$ kepada salah satu daripada $k$ kumpulan dengan pemboleh ubah binari $x_{i,c}$ untuk warna $c \\in \\{1, \\ldots, k\\}$. Kekangan one-hot $\\sum_c x_{i,c} = 1$ untuk setiap nod menguatkuasakan penetapan yang unik. Objektif memaksimumkan tepi silang kumpulan:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\min \\sum_{(u,v) \\in E} \\sum_c x_{u,c} \\, x_{v,c}\\\\\n"
"\\text{s.t.} \\sum_{c} x_{i,c} = 1 \\quad \\forall i \\in  V\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\min \\sum_{(u,v) \\in E} \\sum_c x_{u,c} \\, x_{v,c}\\\\\n"
"\\text{s.t.} \\sum_{c} x_{i,c} = 1 \\quad \\forall i \\in  V\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The one-hot constraints are ideal for XY-mixers, which the optimizer handles natively.\n"
msgstr "Kekangan one-hot adalah ideal untuk XY-mixers, yang dikendalikan secara semula jadi oleh pengoptimum.\n"

